Name: libbase
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/libbase
Version: N/A
Revision: a5c86f3574f744b22a82a8cd08e7fa0bf7210c28
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: //third_party/libunwindstack/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Common helpers from AOSP (android-base): files, strings, logging macros,
unique_fd. libunwindstack, libdexfile and libartbase include them as
"android-base/...", and //third_party/libunwindstack builds them into its
libunwindstack and posix_strerror_r targets.

src/ holds the files BUILD.gn lists, from the upstream repository root,
with patches/ applied.

Local Modifications:
- 0001-disable-fdsan.patch: use fdsan only from Android API 29.
- 0003-remove-file-logging.patch: no-op LOG(), PLOG(), CHECK() and
  CHECK_OP() streams, so no logging.cpp is needed.
- 0007-disable-thread-annotations.patch: no-op thread-safety annotation
  macros.
- 0015-replace-deprecated-enodata.patch: EIO instead of ENODATA.
- 0020-add-missing-includes.patch: add <type_traits> and <iterator>
  includes.

To update, copy those files at the new revision into src/, then run
from this directory:

$ for patch in patches/*.patch; do patch -s -p1 < $patch; done

and update Revision.
